 "remarks": "Welcome to Vista Towers, one of downtown Stamford's desirable residential communities! This spacious 1-bedroom, 1.5-bath condominium offers beautiful city views and water views of Long Island Sound. Enjoy the spectacular scenery and watch the fireworks light up the sky during the 4th of July celebrations! The unit features a generously sized bedroom, elegant hardwood parquet floors, stainless steel appliances, and an additional refrigerator-perfect for wine and beverages. AN ATTRACTIVE INVESTMENT OPPORTUNITY! The unit is currently tenant-occupied, generating $2,250 per month in rental income. The existing lease may be transferred to the new owner, subject to the lease terms, applicable requirements, and any necessary approvals. An excellent opportunity for investors seeking an income-producing property in the heart of downtown Stamford! Doorman on duty from 11 AM to 7 PM Live-in superintendent. Building meticulously cleaned and maintained daily, One assigned parking space included with the unit, Storage unit located in a shared storage room outside the apartment Heat and water included in the HOA fee Convenient public transportation directly across the street Enjoy convenient access to shopping, dining, transportation, and everyday essentials. Approximately a 20-minute walk or a 5-minute drive to shopping malls and the Metro-North train station, offering service to Grand Central Terminal in New York City and New Haven, home to Yale University",
